| **2** | **Reichstag Dome (German Parliament)** | New “Sky‑Walk” experience (glass‑dome tours) is fully booked on Instagram; free registration still open. | 08:00‑20:00 (last entry 19:30) | Free (registration required) | Designed by Sir Norman Foster; 360° city panorama. |
| **3** | **Pergamon Museum (Museum Island)** | “Night‑at‑the‑Museum” pop‑up event (live music, after‑hours tours) draws crowds in Dec 2024. | 10:00‑18:00 (closed Mon) | €19 (combined Island ticket) | Home of the Pergamon Altar & Ishtar Gate. |
| **4** | **Berlin TV Tower (Fernsehturm)** | New “Sky‑Light” dinner concept (launch Jan 2025) already buzzing; observation deck still a must‑see. | 09:00‑24:00 (last entry 23:30) | €25 (observation deck) | Tallest structure in Germany – 368 m. |
